#: a3a0d398922a454aab1d3eb3745c22cf
msgid "Archived:PX4FMU Wiring QuickStart"
msgstr "存档：PX4FMU接线快速入门"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:9
#: a7e76a47ed4d42f39e45ac81865870a0
msgid "**ARCHIVED**"
msgstr "**已归档**"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:11
#: 9437a4bcf42f4644add9344058b2664c
msgid ""
"The PX4FMU is end of life and is not generally available for purchase. This "
"article is made available for existing users."
msgstr "PX4FMU已停产，通常无法购买。本文面向现有用户提供参考。"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:14
#: 2f4e5f1c79264101af3a9c39fbe9e2ef
msgid ""
"This article provides an overview of the :ref:`PX4FMU <common-px4fmu-"
"overview>` and :ref:`PX4IO <common-px4io-overview>` Board Copter "
"Wiring/Installation."
msgstr ""
"本文概述了 :ref:`PX4FMU <common-px4fmu-overview>` 和 :ref:`PX4IO <common-px4io-"
"overview>` 板的ArduCopter接线/安装。"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:18
#: 0c385619e5ce4683bb7a46101d0a9d3c
msgid "PX4FMU plus PX4IO Wiring Diagrams"
msgstr "PX4FMU加PX4IO接线图"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:26
#: f511e4bea4844d4787e43a44ebc4a8c4
msgid ""
"Wiring: PX4FMU plus PX4IO with 3DR 8 channel encoder and 3DR Telemetry radio"
msgstr "接线：PX4FMU加PX4IO，配合3DR 8通道编码器和3DR数传电台"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:29
#: d4b47112a1414d47829c95b7412960ca
msgid "Assembly"
msgstr "组装"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:31
#: 10567776ad4a4f86a224e6f2f92eb994
msgid ""
"**Solder the right angle 9x3 pin connector that was included with your "
"PX4FMU kit to the side of the PX4IO board that has \"PX4 autopilot\" printed"
" on it.**"
msgstr "**将PX4FMU套件中随附的直角9x3针连接器焊接到PX4IO板印有\"PX4 autopilot\"字样的一侧。**"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:35
#: b9ceba32210d4f26ac26e54afc284422
msgid ""
"When you insert the 9 x 3 connector into the PX4IO board put it in with the "
"plastic spacer on the connector facing to the back of the board, NOT down "
"against the board."
msgstr "将 9x3 连接器插入 PX4IO 板时，连接器上的塑料间隔件应朝向板背面，而不是向下靠着板。"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:39
#: 535edb3da2c342d798891fd0a7c8a337
msgid ""
"Solder the small white PAP-02-VS 2 pin connector into the 2 holes directly "
"behind the battery pads on the PX4IO board."
msgstr "将小型白色PAP-02-VS 2针连接器焊接到PX4IO板上电池焊盘后方的2个孔中。"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:41
#: a84b973402594a308adde7d29ca46b57
msgid "**Install the PX4IO board on top of the PX4FMU board.**"
msgstr "**将 PX4IO 板安装在 PX4FMU 板上。**"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:43
#: 7d5f6723c5a542f4a8919d626f4e3e64
msgid ""
"To protect the barometer from wind, gusts, motion effects and prop wash:"
msgstr "为保护气压计免受风、阵风、运动效应和螺旋桨下洗气流的影响："

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:46
#: 8b142f5432924afd8704d813c102c63f
msgid ""
"Cut a piece of 1/2\" thick soft foam to the size of the PX4FMU board minus "
"the inter-board connector."
msgstr "将1/2英寸厚软泡沫裁切至PX4FMU板大小（去除板间连接器部分）。"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:48
#: 89448672d722423c928b74d3e0385053
msgid ""
"Place place the piece of 1/2\" foam between the PX4FMU board and the PX4IO "
"board before you connect them."
msgstr "在连接PX4FMU板和PX4IO板之前，将1/2英寸泡沫片放在两者之间。"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:50
#: daea358dbd46454db5982a77ed3bb8ce
msgid ""
"An enclosure could mitigate barometer problems too, but ensure that it does "
"not interfere with the compass (magnetometer)."
msgstr "外壳也可缓解气压计问题，但请确保不影响罗盘（磁力计）。"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:53
#: b29bb032dffe4dcfb8464cba00ef1adb
msgid ""
"Connect the PX4FMU board to the PX4IO board and ensure all of the connector "
"pins are straight and insertion is complete."
msgstr "将PX4FMU板与PX4IO板连接，确保所有连接针脚笔直且插入完全。"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:55
#: 3b9bd325e2d046e0a13019b82f510754
msgid ""
"Mount the PX4-FMU + PX4-IO board stack in a central and level location on "
"top of your Copter."
msgstr "将PX4-FMU + PX4-IO板叠层安装在飞机顶部中央水平位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:57
#: cae4972c17c44d908988be2aeddc12ac
msgid "The PX4FMU board is normally on top."
msgstr "PX4FMU板通常在上方。"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:58
#: 395be1751d8f45b7a6f630560d9fe9e6
msgid ""
"It can be advantageous to mount the PX4IO board on top to provide for better"
" Connector access."
msgstr "将 PX4IO 板安装在顶部可以提供更好的连接器访问。"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:60
#: c5f58c1bca824788afbf3cf05b8ff834
msgid ""
"If you do mount the PX4IO board on top it will be necessary to set the "
"\"Board Orientation (AHRS_ORIENTATION)\" parameter to **8** i.e \"Roll "
"180\", in the Advanced Parameter List in Mission Planner."
msgstr ""
"如果将PX4IO板安装在上方，则需要在Mission Planner的高级参数列表中将\"Board Orientation "
"(AHRS_ORIENTATION)\"参数设置为 **8**，即\"Roll 180\"。"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:63
#: 00cf9f2d37954137bce8052f81a50d3a
msgid "The arrow labeled \"FRONT\" should be facing to the front of the aircraft."
msgstr "标有\"FRONT\"的箭头应朝向飞机前方。"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:65
#: 50dde46d757b42ccaedfcae2f8b0b3c7
msgid ""
"The Micro SD memory card holder should face to the back of the Aircraft."
msgstr "Micro SD 存储卡槽应朝向飞机后方。"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:68
#: c28e29fc2c7e4a52889e65712072afbb
msgid "**Use the included standoffs and hardware.**"
msgstr "**使用随附的支撑柱和硬件。**"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:70
#: cc23b1fa0c1c42d7a8d4d5e034e4a98b
msgid ""
"Which ever side of which ever board is going to be on top but a black "
"standoff through one of the mounting holes from the bottom and thread a "
"black plastic nut onto it from the top."
msgstr "无论哪块板的哪一面将朝上，从底部将黑色螺柱穿过其中一个安装孔，然后从顶部将黑色塑料螺母拧上。"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:73
#: 3dfcf379cf1043c7b719084422754ef2
msgid "Repeat the above for the remaining 3 holes."
msgstr "对剩余的 3 个孔重复上述操作。"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:74
#: f72b1193c0334599bea5112cd6da7387
msgid ""
"Connect the PX4FMU and PX4IO board insuring no pins are bent on the board "
"interconnection connector."
msgstr "连接 PX4FMU 和 PX4IO 板，确保板间连接连接器上没有弯曲的针脚。"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:76
#: 2b5823da3ba743b9bce4006745ce878a
msgid ""
"Thread 4 more of the black standoffs into the already installed black "
"standoffs."
msgstr "将另外 4 个黑色支撑柱拧入已安装的黑色支撑柱中。"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:79
#: 3b8de2dc15dc4a32b53dc9fc3c344147
msgid ""
"**In order to reduce DC EMF effect on the compass see** :ref:`Magnetic "
"Interference <common-magnetic-interference>`."
msgstr ""
"**为了减少直流电磁场对罗盘的影响，请参阅** :ref:`Magnetic Interference <common-magnetic-"
"interference>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:80
#: 25e4878503d04a78986f7e32c6ed4b22
msgid ""
"You will need additional vibration damping and should review :ref:`Vibration"
" Damping <common-vibration-damping>`."
msgstr "您需要额外的减震措施，建议参阅 :ref:`Vibration Damping <common-vibration-damping>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:83
#: f8d54da26cb24e95b73b4142494cdbe8
msgid "At a minimum you should mount the standoffs to an intermediate plate."
msgstr "至少应将支撑柱固定到中间板上。"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:85
#: 0fcf7b78f2574dab84ef018d4050763b
msgid ""
"Mount the plate to your airframe with 4 small (<1\")square pads of Kyosho "
"\"Zeal\" gel or \"Moon Gel\" in the corners."
msgstr "用4块小型（<1英寸）方形Kyosho \"Zeal\"凝胶垫或\"Moon Gel\"垫粘贴在角落，将该板固定到机架上。"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:88
#: f0475fa8b20142cab45d113495164b0b
msgid "**Mount the GPS facing up with an unobstructed \"view\" of the sky.**"
msgstr "**将 GPS 朝上安装，确保对天空有无遮挡的「视野」。**"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:90
#: bbff08a8aebf41fe980d4dbf4f441064
msgid "Connect the GPS cable to the GPS connector on the PX4FMU board."
msgstr "将 GPS 电缆连接到 PX4FMU 板上的 GPS 连接器。"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:91
#: b0911244098f4de79e8d7c834ec282f6
msgid ""
"The GPS must be positioned so that its cable will connect without strain to "
"the PX4FMU's GPS connector."
msgstr "GPS 的安装位置必须使其电缆能无张力地连接到 PX4FMU 的 GPS 连接器。"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:93
#: aecbc778d8944c1ba4dd02f5e063fbce
msgid ""
"The GPS can be mounted on a short riser to give it the widest satellite "
"access."
msgstr "GPS 可以安装在短的支架上，以获得最广的卫星接收范围。"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:97
#: b39c4757d11e40ef83c6a7709d1f8028
msgid "Wire the PX4FMU and PX4IO boards to Your Copter"
msgstr "将PX4FMU和PX4IO板接线到您的飞行器"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:99
#: 208b06de62954d4fb75ebd1023c6f061
msgid "**Wire the PX4-IO board.**"
msgstr "**连接PX4-IO板的线路。**"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:101
#: 1a460e94925048309735589821f3f6ed
msgid ""
"The PX4IO board has a built in Power Supply which can connect to up to 18 "
"volts."
msgstr "PX4IO 板内置电源模块，可接受最高 18V 的输入电压。"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:103
#: 4f66783c0e694ec5993718bc628e5a3c
msgid ""
"Insert the white PAP-02-VS 2 pin connector with the black and red wires "
"coming out of it into the mating power connector you soldered in previously "
"on the PX4IO board."
msgstr "将带有黑色和红色导线的白色 PAP-02-VS 2 针连接器插入先前在 PX4IO 板上焊接的配套电源连接器中。"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:106
#: 3c1300b1feb84aa5920d24cac8517635
msgid ""
"Battery Plus is the(red wire) and should be soldered to your battery red "
"power lead / connector."
msgstr "电池正极为（红线），应焊接到电池的红色电源导线/接口上。"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:108
#: db0959c342764f7d89a094c3b2db322d
msgid ""
"Battery Ground is the(black wire) and should be soldered to your battery "
"black battery (Ground) lead / connector."
msgstr "电池地线为（黑线），应焊接到电池黑色电池（地线）引线/连接器上。"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:110
#: 26b0bb1ede304b9eba31a2bd7743a69f
msgid ""
"The main power inputs of your ESC's will also need to connect to these wires"
" and to a battery connector."
msgstr "您的ESC主电源输入也需要连接到这些导线以及电池接口上。"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:112
#: 47f8022a860f4dc1b9dece1c3b66183d
msgid "A Power Distribution board can also be used."
msgstr "也可以使用电源分配板。"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:114
#: 3ee5ef30ab6948289ff5fa594e8a2720
msgid ""
"**Connect your PPM-Sum RC receiver's 3 wire cable to the end of the 9 x 3 "
"angle connector that is nearest the edge of the PX4IO board with the signal "
"wire furthest from the board and the ground closest to the board.**"
msgstr "**将 PPM-Sum 遥控接收机的 3 线电缆连接到 9x3 角连接器靠近 PX4IO 板边缘的一端，信号线远离板面，地线靠近板面。**"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:118
#: 306ad91dde9141b9bf1c82a31e904c92
msgid ""
"**Wire the PX4FMU board's servo out signals to your ESC control inputs.**"
msgstr "**将PX4FMU板的舵机输出信号线连接到您的ESC控制输入端。**"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:120
#: 3c1c02660e5648e2892e4459dd6f9575
msgid ""
"Run the Signal wires ONLY from the ESCs to the 3 x 9 Servo Connector on the "
"PX4IO board."
msgstr "仅将信号线从 ESC 连接到 PX4IO 板上的 3×9 舵机连接器。"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:122
#: 9254aafb57a047938ce49f60efee2175
msgid ""
"The PX4IO board connector for Motor 1 is at the edge of the connector next "
"to the Battery power in wires."
msgstr "PX4IO 板上电机 1 的连接器位于靠近电池电源输入线一侧的边缘处。"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:124
#: 1a06d984a3ca4b449fa9ce21bd313dc9
msgid ""
"Insert the Motor ESC wires arranged progressively from that edge, "
"(1,2,3,4,etc) for 4 to 8 motors depending on your copter type."
msgstr "从该边缘依次插入电机ESC线（1、2、3、4等），根据飞行器类型连接4至8个电机。"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:126
#: 48738a5392ef46ba866c8f4e90000f87
msgid ""
"You can put the ESC Signal wires into a single inline connector with the "
"correct number of pins for your copter."
msgstr "您可以将ESC信号线集中插入一个与飞行器电机数量匹配的单排接口中。"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:128
#: e46bf80f74394962904eea9ec4ba466f
msgid ""
"The ESC Signal Wires / connector should be plugged into the top row "
"(furthest from the board) of the PX4IO boards 3 x 9 Servo Connector."
msgstr "ESC 信号线/连接器应插入 PX4IO 板 3×9 舵机连接器的顶排（距板面最远一排）。"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:132
#: b0b87a0cdd3a4b39933ad41b591fa9a3
msgid ""
"**Note, the cable that is supplied in the plastic envelope with the UBLOX "
"GPS which has white 6 pin connectors on both ends is not the correct cable "
"for the PX4FMU board.**"
msgstr "**注意，UBLOX GPS 塑料包装内附赠的两端都是白色 6 针连接器的电缆，不是适用于 PX4FMU 板的正确电缆。**"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:136
#: 5f65de000c91459c878c17230d7cd861
msgid ""
"The correct longer cable is provided in a separate envelope and has a 5 pin "
"\"beige\" connector on one end and a 6 pin white connector on the other end."
msgstr "正确的较长电缆在单独的包装中，一端有 5 针「米色」连接器，另一端有 6 针白色连接器。"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:139
#: 8073821398a246aa99f92ff403ca345e
msgid ""
"Plug the correct GPS cable's white 6 pin connector into the 6 pin socket on "
"the GPS."
msgstr "将正确 GPS 线缆的白色 6 针连接器插入 GPS 上的 6 针插座。"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:141
#: f449f472c63248158c09503ca02dfaa5
msgid ""
"Plug the beige 5 pin connector into the PX4FMU board's 5 pin GPS socket "
"which is next to the 15 pin DF13 Mini connector."
msgstr "将米色 5 针连接器插入 PX4FMU 板上的 5 针 GPS 插座，该插座位于 15 针 DF13 Mini 连接器旁边。"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:144
#: f16cca3669654291a222a9ec827fdb0a
msgid ""
"**Plug the 2 pin connector attached to the lead supplied with the buzzer "
"into the buzzer socket on the side of the PX4FMU board that has the SD card "
"holder on it.**"
msgstr "**将蜂鸣器附带导线上的 2 针连接器插入 PX4FMU 板带有 SD 卡槽一侧的蜂鸣器插座。**"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:147
#: d393b963ca224e31bf334bcb653c63d5
msgid ""
"**Connect the \"Safety Button\" to the Safety connector on the PX4IO board "
"on the opposite side of the board from the Battery pads.**"
msgstr "**将\"安全按钮\"连接到PX4IO板上与电池焊盘相对一侧的安全接口。**"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:151
#: a1b152ec2b6b43519e350add15b865a7
msgid "Using a 3DR telemetry radio with your PX4FMU plus PX4IO system."
msgstr "将3DR数传电台与PX4FMU和PX4IO系统配合使用。"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:153
#: df5fac747ba948c295b087eb5ce19133
msgid "You will need a :ref:`3DR Radio <common-sik-telemetry-radio>`."
msgstr "您需要一个 :ref:`3DR Radio <common-sik-telemetry-radio>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:154
#: e72c38cc86ea4b518203c97c49172250
msgid ""
"Plug the telemetry adapter cable's large black connector into the 3DR radio "
"as shown above."
msgstr "如上图所示，将数传适配线缆的大黑色接口插入3DR电台。"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:156
#: c81b664cea364dbdb08e74de48b1d31b
msgid ""
"The telemetry radio is shown above **incorrectly** connected to the FMU "
"USART2 socket at the corner of the PX4IO board."
msgstr "数传无线电在上图中显示为 **错误地** 连接到 PX4IO 板角落的 FMU USART2 插座。"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:159
#: 63f8fa96eb4e46929ae0d37abda10bf1
msgid ""
"**Correctly** plug the telemetry adapter cable's beige connector into the "
"PX4IO boards **FMU UART5** socket."
msgstr "**正确地** 将数传适配电缆的米色连接器插入 PX4IO 板的 **FMU UART5** 插座。"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:161
#: 935f9c3d620f47d1b09ccc4deec84299
msgid ""
"FMU UART5 is the middle socket on the end of the PX4IO board as indicated by"
" the **red arrow** above."
msgstr "FMU UART5 是 PX4IO 板端部的中间插座，如上方 **红色箭头** 所示。"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:163
#: 9b34fa3804b244f398c06f1c8002bb7c
msgid ""
"(FMU UARTx) means a port that is pass through connected directly from the "
"PX4IO board to the PX4FMU."
msgstr "（FMU UARTx）表示从 PX4IO 板直通连接到 PX4FMU 的端口。"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:167
#: c2925b5cc6394704a9eddaf28252067e
msgid "Separate Servo power for high power applications"
msgstr "大功率应用的独立舵机供电"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:172
#: 7749f27730df42468304c56da70c8a1c
msgid ""
"**Using a separate power supply to provide power to the center servo power "
"pins of the PX4IO board.**"
msgstr "**使用独立电源为 PX4IO 板中央舵机电源针脚供电。**"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:175
#: c910bc93c66c4607b864998199bd3e01
msgid ""
"If you are driving high power servos with your PX4IO board you will want to "
"provide servo power separately."
msgstr "如果您正在用 PX4IO 板驱动大功率舵机，您需要单独提供舵机电源。"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:177
#: a7cb9226669f40d79ee6c7b3716f2c98
msgid ""
"In order to do this, remove the L1 Ferrite device circled in red on the "
"image above."
msgstr "为此，移除上图中红色圆圈标出的 L1 铁氧体器件。"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:179
#: bcfd663d6baa4d819c37bbd31dafeac8
msgid ""
"Then run power from your separate power supply to one of the center pins of "
"the Servo Connector."
msgstr "然后将独立电源的电源线连接到舵机连接器的一个中央针脚。"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:181
#: c3c3e8c496d84b0199a820dbd423b32a
msgid ""
"And run the ground from your separate power supply to one of the servo "
"connector pins nearest the edge of the board."
msgstr "将独立电源的地线连接到靠近板边缘的一个舵机连接器针脚。"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:185
#: 0bd4bebf4a0b405dbf93d12662d6a6c7
msgid "Wiring your Motors and ESCs"
msgstr "电机和ESC接线"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:187
#: 3e2274ea99d645fd8b1b1fccfa5a8301
msgid ""
"Motor wiring and order for different frame shapes is covered in the topic "
":ref:`Connect ESCs and Motors <connect-escs-and-motors>`."
msgstr ""
"不同机架形状的电机接线和顺序请参阅 :ref:`Connect ESCs and Motors <connect-escs-and-motors>` "
"章节。"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:191
#: 98fb76a722d648f08d5d0cc20bdec803
msgid "Using a Standard RC Radio Receiver with an 8 channel PPM Encoder"
msgstr "使用标准遥控接收机和 8 通道 PPM 编码器"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:193
#: 3d2009fc687b4976b22bd1a0892439bd
msgid ""
"You can use a standard radio receiver with an 8 channel PPM Encoder in place"
" of the PPM-SUM receiver."
msgstr "您可以使用带8通道PPM编码器的标准接收机代替PPM-SUM接收机。"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:196
#: 4b67aa9f438c4ceab44a7d6b99aed182
msgid ""
"An 8 Channel PPM Encoder is `available from jDrones "
"<http://store.jdrones.com/pixhawk_px4_paparazzi_ppm_encoder_v2_p/eleppmenc20.htm>`__."
msgstr ""
"8通道PPM编码器可从 `jDrones购买 "
"<http://store.jdrones.com/pixhawk_px4_paparazzi_ppm_encoder_v2_p/eleppmenc20.htm>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:198
#: c6eb57b2af3246d2a12ec2dfc5bea303
msgid ""
"Solder a 3x8 Right angle connector from the top into one end of the 8 "
"Channel PPM Encoder board."
msgstr "将3x8直角连接器从顶部焊接到8通道PPM编码器板的一端。"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:200
#: 0cf771436c42476193464526dae98018
msgid ""
"With the 3x8 connector up and facing away from you, solder a 3x1 Right angle"
" connector on the right edge of the 8 Channel PPM Encoder board."
msgstr "将 3x8 连接器朝上面向您，将 3x1 直角连接器焊接到 8 通道 PPM 编码器板的右侧边缘。"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:204
#: 972afde490e84973b50def4c289d5a8c
msgid ""
"Connect 5-8 output channels of your receiver to the inputs of the 8 Channel "
"Encoder (signal wire furthest from board) with 5-8 female to female servo "
"jumpers."
msgstr "使用5~8根母对母舵机跳线，将接收机的5~8通道输出连接到8通道编码器的输入端（信号线朝外远离板面）。"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:208
#: 9a9982f44c8b4c28af8cd43e896c0b92
msgid ""
"Connect the PPM-SUM output of the Encoder with a 3 wire cable to the PX4IO "
"boards PPM sum input (1x3 connector)."
msgstr "用 3 线电缆将编码器的 PPM-SUM 输出连接到 PX4IO 板的 PPM sum 输入（1x3 连接器）。"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:213
#: 2fa2137c4b074882b33a9879c16c308c
msgid ""
"If you are using a 3DR PPM Encoder it is important to know that when you are"
" calibrating your transmitter you will quite likely need to hook up your "
"flight battery to the PX4IO because the USB port alone can't supply enough "
"power."
msgstr "如果您使用的是3DR PPM编码器，需要注意的是，在校准遥控器时，很可能需要连接飞行电池到PX4IO，因为仅靠USB口无法提供足够的电力。"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:219
#: 559f0df1e0bf444a919930779cb134b1
msgid "Compatible remote control (RC) receivers"
msgstr "兼容的遥控（RC）接收机"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:221
#: 1e2c674c50d2421f81249c840aa2857c
msgid ""
"PX4FMU is compatible with PPM remote control (RC) receivers, Futaba S.Bus "
"receivers, and Spektrum DSM,DSM2, and DSM-X Satellite receivers. For "
"traditional single-wire-per-channel (PWM) receivers a PPM encoder can be "
"used to convert the receiver outputs to PPM-SUM.  Information about "
"compatible receivers and how they are connected can be found in :ref:`this "
"wiki page <common-rc-systems>`."
msgstr ""
"PX4FMU兼容PPM遥控（RC）接收机、Futaba S.Bus接收机以及Spektrum DSM、DSM2和DSM-"
"X卫星接收机。对于传统单线单通道（PWM）接收机，可使用PPM编码器将接收机输出转换为PPM-SUM。有关兼容接收机及连接方法的信息，请参阅 "
":ref:`此Wiki页面 <common-rc-systems>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:230
#: c0b4f9a465c3459a95365b343e17190d
msgid "FRSky Taranis Transmitter"
msgstr "FRSky Taranis遥控器"
